                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-8">
                        <h2 class="sub-heading mb-2 text-center text-lg-left">
                            About Dosti ORO 67
                        </h2>

                        <p>Dosti Oro 67 in Kandivali West is now selling 1, 1.5, 2, and 2.5 Bhk flats that have been designed with all the modern amenities. These flats are being built in four tall towers and will be ready in March 2024. The apartments in the A and B wings have panoramic views of the city, while the flats in the C and D wings have enchanting views of the Pagoda, Mumbai's well-known Meditation dome. There are various ground and roof-top amenities available in Dosti Oro 67, including a Clubhouse, Gym, Indoor Games Corner, Kids Play Area, Sanitation Management, Ample Parking Space, Sanitation Management, and more.</p>

                        <div class="row text-center about-proj-info">
